  itemName: Lightning Saix
  desp: The Lightning Saix is a high-speed land Zoid. The Lightning Saix is well
    armed, carrying a pair of Pulse Laser Rifles on its back, as well as a pair of
    small Vulcan Guns in its head. The Saix's Pulse Laser Rifles only point directly
    forward and cannot be turned, meaning that the Zoid is rather vulnerable to attacks
    from the flanks or behind. However, the fixed position of the back-mounted weapons
    is a necessity, as the Saix would lose its balance if the rifles were to turn
    while running at high speeds.
